/*******************************************************************************
    p4eva.lst

    Driver list for the standalone Pac-Man 4 EVA build. One title, deliberately.
    pacman.cpp is still compiled (pac4eva_state inherits three handlers from it)
    but none of its machines are registered, so the exe knows about exactly one
    game and boots straight into it.
*******************************************************************************/

@source:pacman/pac4eva.cpp
pac4eva          // Pac-Man 4 EVA
